RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Description: scGenePanel creates coordinated, gene-centric multi-panel
    visualizations for single-cell RNA-seq data stored in Seurat or
    SingleCellExperiment objects. It combines group-stratified UMAP embeddings,
    cell-type-specific expression distributions, and quantitative cell-frequency
    and expression summaries in a single figure. An accompanying Shiny
    application supports interactive exploration using the same workflow.
